# Provider adapters

Gemini is the first adapter, not the system.

- Implement `AIProvider` (generate, stream, tools, models, validate, capabilities).
- Route only through `AIProviderManager`.
- Normalize to `AIResponse` / stream events in `normalizers/`.
- OpenAI-compatible custom providers are first-class.
- Do not require React changes to add a provider.

```ts
// ❌ BAD
await gemini.generate(prompt);

// ✅ GOOD
await aiProviderManager.generate({ providerId, modelId, messages });
```
